; Recurring cost budget — used for both budget-vs-actual reporting
; (`hledger balance --budget`) and projecting next quarter's expected
; spend. Update the amounts here when a recurring cost actually changes.
~ monthly
    expenses:communication:sendgrid                34.95 USD
    expenses:donations                             15.00 USD
    expenses:fees:github-sponsors                   0.90 USD
    expenses:backup:backblaze                       1.30 USD
    liabilities:credit-cards:chase:ink-unlimited

; Hetzner bills in EUR, so its budget is in EUR too (hosting net of tax, at
; current prices); budget-vs-actual can't compare EUR actuals to a USD goal.
~ monthly
    expenses:hosting:hetzner                      43.050 EUR
    expenses:taxes:sales:hetzner                   2.130 EUR
    liabilities:accounts-payable:hetzner

